ent.com/images/M45Mg8AXtNfXU0V5LQ9tHVg8w10.jpg?scale-down-to=2048&width=5774&height=4000 2048w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/M45Mg8AXtNfXU0V5LQ9tHVg8w10.jpg?scale-down-to=4096&width=5774&height=4000 4096w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/M45Mg8AXtNfXU0V5LQ9tHVg8w10.jpg?width=5774&height=4000 5774w`},`man in green crew neck shirt smiling`),quote:`On time, under budget, and they remembered our dog’s name.`,role:`Slow Burn Candles`},{colour:`var(--token-3e8e48f1-d179-4e20-8e19-0e0ed614f382, rgb(223, 168, 186))`,id:`m83oq28Sv`,name:`Mia Chen`,quote:`The packaging sells the balms before anyone reads the label.`,role:`Nettle & Bloom`},{colour:`var(--token-4bf103fc-9219-46e5-bdfe-3e6b456af1ec, rgb(234, 234, 234))`,id:`pj5yquWKh`,name:`Jonah Reid`,photo:Q({pixelHeight:1824,pixelWidth:1919,src:`https://framerusercontent.com/images/GZn1Swn35Ii43O8ddlq0KpCJKzs.jpg?width=1919&height=1824`,srcSet:`https://framerusercontent.com/images/GZn1Swn35Ii43O8ddlq0KpCJKzs.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1919&height=1824 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/GZn1Swn35Ii43O8ddlq0KpCJKzs.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1919&height=1824 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/GZn1Swn35Ii43O8ddlq0KpCJKzs.jpg?width=1919&height=1824 1919w`},`a man in a red shirt holding two fingers up`),quote:`Every meeting felt like a craft afternoon. Every deadline was met.`,role:`Loudhouse Records`},{colour:`rgb(255, 212, 92)`,id:`oWtw7aOpC`,name:`Tom Okafor`,quote:`Three rounds in clay before a single pixel. Weird. Worked.`,role:`Musse Design Week`},{colour:`var(--token-2b1500cf-4b8a-4c0a-a6bc-bb9fb95b7571, rgb(255, 187, 0))`,id:`Jh2_aqeDa`,name:`Lena Fischer`,quote:`We asked for a logo and left with a whole personality. The good kind.`,role:`Pocket Pasta`},{colour:`var(--token-e668fce1-bd66-4ad7-83a2-7f7e8096693e, rgb(242, 242, 242))`,id:`Fjut8F8Ej`,name:`Ade Bello`,photo:Q({pixelHeight:2499,pixelWidth:2622,src:`https://framerusercontent.com/images/OgEPeecKl8ZS8vXxYo4dUxecQ.jpg?width=2622&height=2